ce":"仁","kind":"person","person_id":"2jn_tjp_75n","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi","book_id":"b-shiji-103","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-103-wanshi"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p026","text":"太史公曰：仲尼有言曰「君子欲訥於言而敏於行」，其萬石、建陵、張叔之謂邪？是以其教不肅而成，不嚴而治。塞侯微巧，而周文處讇君子譏之，爲其近於佞也。然斯可謂篤行君子矣！","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m026-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m026-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m026-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"萬石","kind":"person","person_id":"esh_e0a_jrw_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m026-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"張叔","kind":"person","person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m026-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"周文","kind":"person","person_id":"2jn_tjp_75n","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi","book_id":"b-shiji-103","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-103-wanshi"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:p002","text":"鄧通，蜀郡南安人也，以濯舩為黃頭郎。孝文帝夢欲上天，不能，有一黃頭郎從後推之上天，顧見其衣裻帶后穿。覺而之漸臺，以夢中陰目求推者郎，即見鄧通，其衣后穿，夢中所見也。召問其名姓，姓鄧氏，名通，文帝說焉，尊幸之日異。通亦願謹，不好外交，雖賜洗沐，不欲出。於是文帝賞賜通巨萬以十數，官至上大夫。文帝時時如鄧通家遊戲。然鄧通無他能，不能有所薦士，獨自謹其身以媚上而已。上使善相者相通，曰「當貧餓死」。文帝曰：「能富通者在我也。何謂貧乎？」於是賜鄧通蜀嚴道銅山，得自鑄錢，「鄧氏錢」布天下。其富如此。文帝嘗病癰，鄧通常為帝唶吮之。文帝不樂，從容問通曰：「天下誰最愛我者乎？」通曰：「宜莫如太子。」太子入問病，文帝使唶癰，唶癰而色難之。已而聞鄧通常為帝唶吮之，心慚，由此怨通矣。及文帝崩，景帝立，鄧通免，家居。居無何，人有告鄧通盜出徼外鑄錢。下吏驗問，頗有之，遂竟案，盡沒入鄧通家，尚負責數巨萬。長公主賜鄧通，吏輒隨沒入之，一簪不得著身。於是長公主乃令假衣食。竟不得名一錢，寄死人家。孝景帝時，中無寵臣，然獨郎中令周文仁，仁寵最過庸，乃不甚篤。今天子中寵臣，士人則韓王孫嫣，宦者則李延年。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m002-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"鄧通","kind":"person","person_id":"qow_wy0_7d2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m002-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m002-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"鄧通","kind":"person","person_id":"qow_wy0_7d2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m002-0093","start":93,"end":94,"surface":"通","kind":"person","person_id":"qow_wy0_7d2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m002-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m002-0106","start":106,"end":107,"surface":"通","kind":"person","person_id":"qow_wy0_7d2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m002-0127","start":127,"end":129,"surface":"文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m002-0131","start":131,"end":132,"surface":"通","kind":"person","person_id":"qow_wy0_7d2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m002-0144","start":144,"end":146,"surface":"文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m002-0149","start":149,"end":151,"surface":"鄧通","kind":"person","person_id":"qow_wy0_7d2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m002-0156","start":156,"end":158,"surface":"鄧通","kind":"person","person_id":"qow_wy0_7d2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m002-0176","start":176,"end":177,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m002-0180","start":180,"end":181,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-125-ningxing:m002-0186","start":186,"end":187,"surface":"通","kind":"person","person_id":"qow_wy0_7d2",